
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Universal Document Forensics in your work, please cite this software."
type: software

title: "Universal Document Forensics"
abstract: >-
  A local, cross-platform Python tool for forensic examination
  of Microsoft Office and PDF documents. It examines metadata,
  document structures, file integrity, software identifiers,
  and technical characteristics potentially associated with
  programmatic document generation. Findings are presented
  in human-readable reports without automatically concluding
  that artificial intelligence was used.

